---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="机场推荐 2026 - 高性价比/稳定/便宜/专线精选排行榜 - 机场点击"
	description="机场点击 (jichang.click) 是专注机场推荐的中文测评站:2026 机场排行榜、高性价比机场推荐、稳定机场推荐、便宜机场推荐、专线机场推荐,告别虚假测速,帮你快速选到靠谱的原生解锁机场。"
>
	<main class="flex-1">
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50/70 via-slate-50 to-slate-50 min-h-[85vh] flex items-center">
			
			<!-- 背景装饰 -->
			<div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 left-1/2 h-96 w-[48rem] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-200/40 to-teal-500/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
			
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 w-full py-16">
				<div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]">
					
					<!-- 左侧文案 -->
					<div class="pr-8">
						<span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-50/80 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-700 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-emerald-500/20 backdrop-blur-sm">
							<span class="mr-1.5 flex h-2 w-2">
								<span class="absolute inline-flex h-2 w-2 animate-ping rounded-full bg-emerald-500 opacity-75"></span>
								<span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
							</span>
							<span id="hero-date">2026 年持续实测更新</span>
						</span>
						
						<h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-6xl">
							2026 机场推荐
							<span class="mt-2 block bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent leading-normal pb-2">
								高性价比 · 稳定 · 便宜 · 专线精选排行榜
							</span>
						</h1>
						
						<p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-loose text-slate-600 sm:text-lg">
							告别虚假测速与无脑吹捧。基于真实晚高峰环境，深度横评全网高性价比专线。为你彻底解决流媒体与 AI 工具的网络封锁难题。
						</p>
						
						<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
							<a href="#top-1" class="rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/30 hover:bg-emerald-400 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-emerald-500 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
								查看机场排行榜
							</a>
							<a href="#compare" class="rounded-xl bg-white px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
