				<div class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2 pr-4 border-r border-slate-300">
					<span class="relative flex h-3 w-3">
					  <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
					  <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-3 w-3 bg-emerald-500"></span>
					</span>
					<span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">最新情报</span>
				</div>
				<div class="ml-4 flex-1 overflow-hidden relative">
					<!-- CSS Marquee Animation -->
					<div class="flex whitespace-nowrap animate-[marquee_25s_linear_infinite] hover:[animation-play-state:paused]">
						<span class="mx-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600"><span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold dynamic-date-0"></span>：闪跃机场上新原生台湾节点，实测解锁动画疯、Netflix 绝佳。</span>
						<span class="mx-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">|</span>
						<span class="mx-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600"><span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold dynamic-date-1"></span>：一翻云开启 9 折特惠，新老用户均可使用专属优惠码。</span>
						<span class="mx-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">|</span>
