						<span class="mx-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">|</span>
						<span class="mx-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600"><span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold dynamic-date-2"></span>：跨界云大幅降低入门门槛，新增 20 元轻度平价套餐。</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- 机场排行榜专区 -->
		<section id="rankings" class="py-24 bg-white relative scroll-mt-12">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
