							老叶的排位加权公式 (满分 10.0)
						</div>
						<p class="mb-2">下面的评分绝不是凭感觉捏造的，而是基于以下 5 个核心维度的长期测试加权得出：</p>
						<ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs mb-3 text-slate-600 font-medium">
							<li>• 晚高峰速度 (30%权重)</li>
							<li>• 稳定性/丢包率 (25%权重)</li>
							<li>• 价格与性价比 (20%权重)</li>
							<li>• 流媒体原生解锁 (15%权重)</li>
							<li>• 跑路风险评估 (10%权重)</li>
						</ul>
						<a href="/methodology" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-emerald-600 font-bold hover:text-emerald-500 hover:underline">查看完整的打分标准与抓包原理 &rarr;</a>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-6 inline-flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-slate-500 shadow-sm">
						<span class="font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg> 本站实测环境声明：</span>
